game/a-79965822--24b2767125c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-makes-grand-theft-auto-vi-more-than-just-a-game/a-79965822?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">When "GTA VI" is released on November 19, millions of people worldwide will rush to their consoles to play it. How has this video game created such a cross-generational buzz?</summary><category term="Technology" /></entry><entry><title>Trump kicks off Asia tour ahead of major talks with Putin, Xi in China</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:40b64cb8385e9d954352dbf274d80b53f21587be6cba7b1976769ce01cfe6ebb</id><updated>2026-11-17T17:41:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-kicks-off-asia-tour-ahead-of-major-talks-with-putin-xi-in-china/live-79964719--bda6332dd0f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-kicks-off-asia-tour-ahead-of-major-talks-with-putin-xi-in-china/live-79964719?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump flew into Manila for a Quad meeting before he takes off to China for a much anticipated meet with Russian and Chinese counterparts. Follow live.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Canada, China agree to ease tariffs amid trade rows with US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:39cd9a86894a73b375f84bedafe9fe3cc5a48d1f988924b69f3b4e9b7868298f</id><updated>2026-11-17T17:41:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T07:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/canada-china-agree-to-ease-tariffs-amid-trade-rows-with-us/a-79964912--5804d9c43235.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/canada-china-agree-to-ease-tariffs-amid-trade-rows-with-us/a-79964912?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Canadian and Chinese leaders have vowed closer cooperation as both nations seek to reduce reliance on the US. Canada's government said it had agreed to further reduce tariffs on a range of products.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
